<%@ page language="java" contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8"
    pageEncoding="UTF-8"%>
<%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="jakarta.tags.core" %>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>오시는 길 | 너와 나의 연결고리</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/css/findmap.css">
    
   <script type="text/javascript" src="//dapi.kakao.com/v2/maps/sdk.js?appkey=여기에_자바스크립트_키를_넣으세요"></script>

<script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/js/map.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="location-page">

    <jsp:include page="/view/common/header.jsp" />
    
    <main class="main-content">
        <div class="layout-container">
             <section class="page-title-area">
                <h2>오시는 길</h2>
                <p>소중한 생명을 만나는 곳, <strong>너와 나의 연결고리</strong>로 오시는 방법을 안내해 드립니다</p>
             </section>
             
             <div class="map-container">
                 <div id="map"></div>
             </div>
             
             <section class="location-details">
                 <div class="detail-item">
                     <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon">location_on</span>
                     <div class="text-box">
                         <span class="label">주소</span>
                         <p>대전광역시 중구 중앙로 121 (선화동 20, 대덕빌딩 2층)</p>
                     </div>
                 </div>
                 <div class="detail-item">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon">call</span>
                    <div class="text-box">
                        <span class="label">연락처</span>
                        <p>042-222-8202</p>
                    </div>
                 </div>
                 <div class="detail-item">
                      <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon">train</span>
                      <div class="text-box">
                          <span class="label">지하철</span>
                          <p>서대전네거리역 4번 출구, 오룡역 1번 출구</p>
                      </div>
                   </div>
                   <div class="detail-item">
                       <span class="material-symbols-outlined icon">directions_bus</span>
                       <div class="text-box">
                           <span class="label">버스</span>
                           <p>101, 103, 315, 603, 614, 618</p>
                       </div>
                   </div>
             </section>
        </div>
    </main>
    
    <jsp:include page="/view/common/footer.jsp" />
    
    <script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/js/map.js"></script>

</body>
</html>